#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:72 d195f8c2e72946f0b338a4fa375ee3da
msgid ""
"Before you engage in an activity that will take you a significant amount of "
"time, like implementing a new feature, it’s always good to contact us first, "
"preferably via the :ref:`qubes-devel <introduction/support:qubes-devel>` "
"mailing list. Once we’ve worked out the details, we’ll be grateful to :ref:"
"`receive your patch <developer/code/source-code:how to send patches>`."
msgstr ""
"在您投入大量時間進行某項活動（例如實作新功能）之前，最好先聯繫我們，最好是透"
"過 :ref:`qubes-devel <introduction/support:qubes-devel>` 郵件列表。一旦我們討"
"論好細節，我們將感激地 :ref:`接收您的修補程式 <developer/code/source-code:"
"how to send patches>`。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:77 1722db67231449d7a9adb45aa9aef26e
msgid "Using AI in contributions"
msgstr "在貢獻中使用 AI"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:79 38c0ed5588154c119b53172d765b606c
msgid ""
"If you use generative AI in your contributions, you must disclose this at "
"the time you submit your contribution. If you do not disclose use of "
"generative AI, and the reviewer has reason to believe that it has been used, "
"your contribution is likely to be deprioritized and may be denied without "
"further review, at the discretion of the reviewer. If you intentionally and "
"repeatedly fail to disclose your use of generative AI in a way that is "
"disruptive for the project or its reviewers you may be banned from further "
"contributions or, in severe cases, from participating in the project "
"altogether."
msgstr ""
"如果您在貢獻中使用生成式 AI，您必須在提交貢獻時揭露此事。如果您未揭露使用生成"
"式 AI，且審查者有理由相信您已使用，您的貢獻可能會被降低優先級，並可能由審查者"
"酌情決定在未經進一步審查的情況下拒絕。如果您故意且反覆未能揭露使用生成式 AI，"
"且方式對專案或其審查者造成干擾，您可能會被禁止進一步貢獻，或在嚴重情況下，被"
"禁止參與該專案。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:81 8a5a0409d50d4468b141c3bbb1ddd193
msgid ""
"All contributions to the Qubes OS Project are carefully reviewed by humans "
"to evaluate whether they meet the project's standards. Generative AI allows "
"potential contributors to generate large amounts of content quickly and at "
"near-zero cost. If these contributions are of high quality, they will be "
"welcome. Unfortunately, however, they are often of low quality, in which "
"case it is easy for even a single GenAI-assisted contributor to overwhelm "
"the entire project's human review capacity."
msgstr ""
"所有對 Qubes OS 專案的貢獻都經過人工仔細審查，以評估是否符合專案標準。生成式 "
"AI 讓潛在貢獻者能夠快速且以接近零成本產生大量內容。如果這些貢獻品質高，它們將"
"受到歡迎。然而不幸的是，它們通常品質較低，在這種情況下，即使只有一個 GenAI 輔"
"助的貢獻者，也很容易壓垮整個專案的人工審查能力。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:83 b6a48fdfd00b45be9fe075dc9d8ecbfe
msgid ""
"Regardless of how your content was created, you will be considered the fully-"
"accountable author of that content, and you are responsible for reviewing & "
"fixing such output before submitting it."
msgstr ""
"無論您的內容是如何建立的，您都將被視為該內容的完全負責作者，並且您有責任在提"
"交之前審查和修正此類輸出。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:85 b2109a1e30594b22b1c14cc7d6264b52
msgid ""
"This policy applies to every way in which you may contribute to, or interact "
"with, the project, including (but not limited to) code, patches, packages, "
"issue tracking, reporting security issues, documentation, artwork, "
"discussion forums, mailing lists, social media, chat, and email."
msgstr ""
"此政策適用於您可能貢獻或與專案互動的每一種方式，包括（但不限於）程式碼、修補"
"程式、套件、議題追蹤、回報安全性議題、文件、視覺藝術作品、討論論壇、郵件列"
"表、社群媒體、聊天和電子郵件。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:90 dc9faa5d4c5244ff813474d62ac7443b
msgid "Bounties"
msgstr "賞金"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:92 8ff1424e068f402ab544d4881db05447
msgid ""
"The Qubes OS Project allows members of the community to place unofficial "
"bounties on :doc:`issues </introduction/issue-tracking>`. These bounties are "
"not officially sponsored, endorsed, guaranteed, or paid by the Qubes OS "
"Project. The person or group of people offering a bounty are responsible for "
"paying it, and they decide the value of the bounty, the terms of payment, "
"and the acceptance criteria. Contributors who wish to collect a bounty "
"should coordinate with those offering the bounty to ensure that their work "
"will result in a successful bounty payment."
msgstr ""
"Qubes OS 專案允許社群成員在 :doc:`議題 </introduction/issue-tracking>` 上放置"
"非官方的賞金。這些賞金並非由 Qubes OS 專案官方贊助、認可、保證或支付。提供賞"
"金的個人或團體負責支付賞金，他們決定賞金的價值、支付條款和驗收標準。希望領取"
"賞金的貢獻者應與提供賞金的人協調，以確保他們的工作能成功獲得賞金報酬。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:94 ef137a0699b54998875ac47e78f0274a
msgid ""
"Since bounties are unofficial, it's important to understand that a "
"successful bounty doesn't necessarily mean that a contribution will be "
"accepted by the Qubes OS Project. Since those who offer a bounty are free to "
"set whatever acceptance criteria they like, it's possible that those "
"acceptance criteria could differ significantly from the Qubes OS Project's "
"acceptance criteria for contributions, which can lead to situations in which "
"a bounty is paid, yet the work doesn't get integrated into Qubes afterwards. "
"Whether this is a problem depends on your goals: Some people are satisfied "
"with a work product that they can use, even if it doesn't get officially "
"integrated into the project, while others are not. If official integration "
"is important to you, you can make the bounty contingent on the contribution "
"being officially integrated into Qubes."
msgstr ""
"由於賞金是非官方的，重要的是要了解成功的賞金並不一定表示貢獻會被 Qubes OS 專"
"案接受。由於提供賞金的人可以自由設定他們喜歡的任何驗收標準，這些驗收標準可能"
"與 Qubes OS 專案的貢獻驗收標準有顯著差異，這可能導致賞金已支付，但成果之後並"
"未整合到 Qubes 中的情況。這是否是個問題取決於您的目標：有些人對他們可以使用的"
"成果感到滿意，即使它沒有正式整合到專案中，而其他人則不然。如果官方整合對您很"
"重要，您可以讓賞金的支付取決於貢獻是否正式整合到 Qubes 中。"

#: ../../../introduction/contributing.rst:96 f60cacef055747e78325febededccc3c
msgid ""
"Contributors who complete a bounty issue sometimes choose to have the bounty "
"donated to the Qubes OS Project instead of collecting it themselves. In that "
"case, the bounty issuer should use one of the methods on the `donation "
"<https://www.qubes-os.org/donate/>`__ page to send the bounty to the project."
msgstr ""
"完成賞金議題的貢獻者有時會選擇將賞金捐贈給 Qubes OS 專案，而不是自己領取。在"
"這種情況下，賞金發出者應使用 `捐款 <https://www.qubes-os.org/donate/>`__ 頁面"
"上的其中一種方法將賞金發送給專案。"
